{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonfire Simulator</strong> is a cozy and realistic campfire simulation game where you can light fires, manage their warmth, and decorate your surroundings to create the perfect fireside experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light your own campfire</strong> \u2013 Gather logs, strike a spark, and watch the flames come alive with lifelike fire effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the elements</strong> \u2013 Brave changing weather conditions and keep your fire burning through rain, wind, and snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook and enjoy meals</strong> \u2013 Use your campfire to prepare food and gain helpful buffs for your next adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore diverse environments</strong> \u2013 Build campfires in serene forests, snowy mountains, remote islands, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover hidden events</strong> \u2013 Encounter random events, uncover secrets, and collect rare embers to strengthen your fires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your campsite</strong> \u2013 Earn and unlock camping gear to customize your surroundings and make your fireside moments truly unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, relax, and immerse yourself in the soothing atmosphere of a crackling fire under the ever-changing sky.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920940?t=1758605990","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3920940?t=1758605990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/a3aeb6625eb66173a3ba749448d4ce0f2928f103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758605990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920940/a3aeb6625eb66173a3ba749448d4ce0f2928f103/capsu